# Line endings are part of this repository's output, not a local preference.
#
# `schemas/*.json` are published artifacts: other tools read them, and the test
# suite compares them byte-for-byte against the schemas generated from the zod
# definitions. A checkout that rewrote them to CRLF would fail that comparison
# on Windows and, worse, would mean the "published schema" differs per platform.
# The same reasoning applies to every text file here — nothing in this repository
# requires CRLF (there are no PowerShell, batch, or shell scripts), so LF is
# enforced repository-wide in the working tree as well as in the index.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Belt and braces for the binary assets. `text=auto` already detects these, but
# stating it means a corrupting eol conversion can never depend on heuristics.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.tela binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
